From 51ae4df1a27141dc1f2b4d997ad693925792ef88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: boxdot <d@zerovolt.org>
Date: Mon, 19 Jun 2023 10:51:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Upgrade clap 3 to clap 4

This also removes the dependency on the unmaintained crate atty.

Closes #828
---
 Cargo.toml  |   2 +-
 src/main.rs | 107 +++++++++++-----------
 3 files changed, 258 insertions(+), 104 deletions(-)

